fixture ground_turnaround
doc BUILD.md s5 Ground: "Turnaround 2 f, keeps 60% speed in the new direction"; s15 "Turning around never produces a dead frame; the sprite flips on the input frame"
room test/flat
frames 24
input
  0..11 R
  12..23 L
end
expect
  at 11 vx=2304 facing=1
  # The input frame: facing flips and the body already moves the new way at 60% (1382).
  at 12 facing=-1 vx=-1382 x<x@11
  at 13 vx=-1843
  at 14 vx=-2304
  during 12..23 vx<0 facing=-1
end
